                            <a href="#"><img src="images/what-are-the-different-types-of-ads-used-in-ppc.webp" class="img-responsive" alt="What are the different types of ads used in PPC?" /></a><br>
                            <div class="cus-bullet">
                                <h3>TABLE OF CONTENT</h3>
                                <li><a href="#1">Paid Search Marketing</a></li>
                                <li><a href="#2">Display Advertising</a></li>
